722
01:06:27,799 --> 01:06:29,098
Me ajude.

723
01:06:31,895 --> 01:06:33,394
Me proteja.

724
01:06:49,844 --> 01:06:51,310
Me tire daqui.

725
01:07:15,319 --> 01:07:16,684
Jack?

726
01:07:20,547 --> 01:07:21,812
Jack?

727
01:07:43,258 --> 01:07:44,590
Jack?

728
01:07:48,053 --> 01:07:49,452
Jack?

729
